{"steam_appid":2191500,"steam_name":"Vampires: Bloodlord Rising","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2191500/217056652/8fbbca336b26b62ef9be8e4bc3b3552dd4db5e1d/1783587905/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1783590263","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257373496/075709c7bc92c538ea7762496f3c1ae73dc7148a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1783590263","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/e1da9c3feac9e30333cb16eae63b4e185cc825e5/ss_e1da9c3feac9e30333cb16eae63b4e185cc825e5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783590265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/094cc080dd2b4b4b1e1d00998e4962d203f516d5/ss_094cc080dd2b4b4b1e1d00998e4962d203f516d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783590265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/93be2b981c3d2dd99a61042589d3c3f723df6b52/ss_93be2b981c3d2dd99a61042589d3c3f723df6b52.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783590265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/1097cc8246d92129a81e8f15f92406e8cd497ca2/ss_1097cc8246d92129a81e8f15f92406e8cd497ca2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783590265","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/22771d83f287ed7ea23b7852eb4f0133f5cc3ab9/ss_22771d83f287ed7ea23b7852eb4f0133f5cc3ab9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1783590265"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Dragos. A survivor of a vampire attack, turned into a creature of the night. Roam the <strong>open world</strong> of medieval Sangavia and forge a powerful <strong>Vampire Dominion</strong>. Build your <strong>castle</strong>, turn <strong>villagers into servants</strong> and explore a <strong>vast gothic-inspired open world</strong>. Whether you <strong>play solo or in co-op</strong>, your choices define your legacy. Will you reign from a palace of terror, or become the lord your people need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1783590265\" width=1500 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE A DARK, OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken from slumber as a weakened vampire lord in the cursed land of Sangavia. <strong>Rebuild your fallen castle</strong>. Its heart, the <strong>Castle Core</strong>, is still pulsing with ancient hunger. <strong>Fuel the Core with blood</strong> to <strong>unlock new regions</strong>, <strong>discover hidden areas</strong> shrouded in mist, and <strong>reclaim your power</strong> in a <strong>dark action-adventure</strong> with <strong>castle building</strong>, <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>RPG elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR DREAM CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.mp4?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild your fortress</strong> and shape it to your will - towering halls, secret chambers, and gothic spires rising from the night. Your castle is your refuge, your power, and the true symbol of your <strong>growing dominion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROW YOUR VAMPIRE FOLLOWING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with prey. <strong>Feed on humans and beasts</strong> that roam the night to <strong>regain your strength</strong> and fuel your <strong>dark rituals</strong>. Command loyal <strong>vampire thralls</strong> to serve your will - from <strong>crafting</strong>, <strong>hunting</strong>, and <strong>building</strong> to protecting your <strong>dark empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CO-OP MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.mp4?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Child of the Night, you don’t have to be alone. <strong>Invite your friends to rule the land as equals</strong> and see where your individual decisions lead you. Unleash your creativity when you <strong>build your castle together</strong>. Explore the grim, sinister and bloody Sangavia as a team and face the dangers waiting in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE AS A VAMPIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.mp4?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>survive the night</strong>, you must evolve your <strong>vampiric abilities</strong> through an intricate <strong>skill tree</strong> and embrace the forms that shape your legacy. Shift between the <strong>Aristocrat</strong> and <strong>Hunter</strong> forms, or <strong>transform into a bat</strong> to roam the skies and uncover distant lands. Power invites resistance, and the <strong>Inquisition</strong> will never stop hunting you. Crush their holy warriors in brutal, <strong>skill-based combat</strong> to defend your vampire reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1783590265\" width=1500 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Castle Core, awaken forgotten power, and uncover the secrets of Sangavia. Rule the night alone, or rise alongside up to three allies in 4-player co-op.</strong></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-12600K or AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070, 8 GB or AMD Radeon RX Vega 56, 8 GB or Intel Arc A580, 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low, 50% of 1080p @ 30 FPS, SSD recommended</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 (x64)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i9-14900K or AMD Ryzen 9 7950X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti, 8 GB or AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT, 12 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High, 66% of 1080p @ 60 FPS, SSD recommended</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","RPG","Simulation","Early Access"],"developers":["Mehuman Games"],"publishers":["Toplitz Productions"],"release_date":"30 Jan, 2026"}